<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n114337" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χολερ-ικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of</i> or <i>like cholera,</i> [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάθεα</span>] <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Epid.</u>
				7.82
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				S.E.
				<u>P.</u>
				1.131
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of persons,
				<i>suffering from cholera,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				4.4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				6.564
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.831b
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χολερικῇ ληφθῆναι</span> to be attacked
			by <i>cholera,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.L.
				6.76
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>liable to produce cholera,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Xenocr.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				2.58.84
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
    <div class="alpheios-lex-alph-source">From <u>
            <u>A Greek-English Lexicon</u>
        </u> (Henry George Liddell, Robert Scott, Oxford, Clarendon Press, 1940) </div>
